{%- comment -%}
  The "Add buttons", "Satin linings" and "Embroidery" products only exist so
  the hat customiser can add them to the cart automatically alongside a hat.
  They must never be bought on their own — if a customer lands on one of
  these product pages directly (search, old link, etc.) and buys it there,
  it goes into the cart with no connection to a hat and none of the
  embroidery/satin details attached, which is exactly what caused order
  #7412 to show "Embroidery" and "Satin linings" with no colour or text.
  This hides the normal buy flow on those 3 pages and points the customer
  back to the hats collection instead.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign sh_addon_handles = 'add-buttons-1,satin-linings,embroidery' | split: ',' -%}
{%- if sh_addon_handles contains product.handle -%}
  <style>
    .product { display: none !important; }
  </style>
  <div class="scrubhat-addon-guard">
    <p>
      This is an add-on for our scrub hat customisation options and isn't sold on its own.
      Open one of our hats and use the "Customise your hat" panel to add embroidery, buttons, or a satin lining.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}collections/hats" class="button">Browse our hats</a>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
